course: dictionary
lesson: 1478
title: One word, more than one meaning
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Many words have more than one meaning. To pick the right one, read the sentence around it. «The Mekong giant catfish is one of the biggest freshwater fish, as heavy as a bear» tells you catfish is an animal that lives in rivers.
explain: Some words also have newer meanings. A catfish is a fish with long whiskers around its mouth, like a cat's. But online, catfish is slang: to catfish someone means to pretend to be another person, with a false name and photos, to trick them.
explain: How do you know which meaning is right? Ask whether the sentence is about water and fish, or about people and screens. Then try the meaning in the sentence. If it still makes sense, you have found it.
fact: A word can have more than one meaning, and the context tells you which one is meant.
fact: A catfish is a fish with long whiskers around its mouth, like a cat's.
fact: «The Mekong giant catfish» is one of the biggest freshwater fish, and it is now very rare.
fact: Catfish online is slang: to catfish someone means to pretend to be another person online to trick them.
fact: If someone online makes you feel unsure or uncomfortable, tell a trusted adult straight away.
exercise: «The Mekong giant catfish is one of the biggest freshwater fish.» What is a catfish in this sentence? | A cat that lives in a pond | *A fish with long whiskers around its mouth | A boat used on rivers | A person who pretends to be someone else online
exercise: Maya's new online friend has a false name and someone else's photos. Her friend says, «I think they are catfishing you.» What does catfishing mean? | Playing a game with a cat | Catching fish with a net in a river | *Pretending to be someone else online to trick people | Sending lots of photos to a friend
exercise: «The candiru is a tiny, thin catfish that feeds on the blood of bigger fish.» What does thin tell you about the catfish? | It is very loud | It can fly | It is made of metal | *It is slim, not fat
test: «An electric eel is really a knifefish, related to catfish and carp, not a true eel.» Which statement is true? | Catfish are a kind of bird | *Catfish are a different group of fish from eels | Catfish are the same as true eels | Catfish are always electric
test: Ben's online friend has never met him, uses a false name, and says she is his age, but her photos are of someone else. Which word describes this? | Swimming | Tabby | Whiskering | *Catfishing
exam: «The Mekong giant catfish is now very rare.» Which meaning of catfish fits this sentence? | A rare coin | A cat sitting on a fence | *A fish with long whiskers around its mouth | A person who tricks people online
